		<r3d:repositoryName language="eng">National Rodent Laboratory Animal Resource Bank</r3d:repositoryName>
				<r3d:additionalName language="zho">国家啮齿动物实验室动物资源库</r3d:additionalName>
				<r3d:repositoryUrl>http://nrla.nifdc.org.cn</r3d:repositoryUrl>
				<r3d:description language="eng">Based on the needs of national scientific and technological innovation for laboratory animal resources, we use various methods such as foreign introduction, domestic collection, independent research and development, and protocol conservation to collect, integrate, and optimize laboratory animal resources. The resource library now preserves more than 200 varieties and strains in four categories, including mice, rats, guinea pigs, and rabbits, including routine laboratory animals, genetically modified animal models, and animal models for disease.
The predecessor of the resource bank was the National Rodent Laboratory Animal Seed Center (Guoke Cai Zi [1998] No. 010), established in 1998 and based on the Laboratory Animal Resources Research Institute of the Chinese National Academy of Food and Drug Administration.</r3d:description>
